    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Dreamless Kingdom</strong>, no one dreams for themselves. Dreams have been extracted and replaced with lifeless replicas\u2014beautiful but hollow. You play as a quiet traveler who begins to restore these forgotten dreams by helping the kingdom's villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamless Kingdom</strong> is a third\u00a0person\u00a0<strong>narrative-driven exploration game</strong> blending light puzzle-solving, atmospheric storytelling, and surreal world-building. As you traverse\u00a0 vibrant biomes, you\u2019ll encounter strange villagers, unlock their suppressed hopes, and stitch together the fractured emotional tapestry of a once-vibrant world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore Lost Dreams</strong>: Recover scattered dreams and return them to their rightful owners to transform their environment and inner world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Rich Puzzles</strong>: Solve environmental challenges that are tied to character arcs and world lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct Biomes</strong>: Explore painterly regions, each shaped by a unique emotional state and visual language.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living Archive</strong>: Unlock journal entries, memories, and lore artifacts that reveal the hidden history of the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Dreamless Kingdom</strong>, no one dreams for themselves. Dreams have been extracted and replaced with lifeless replicas\u2014beautiful but hollow. You play as a quiet traveler who begins to restore these forgotten dreams by helping the kingdom's villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamless Kingdom</strong> is a third\u00a0person\u00a0<strong>narrative-driven exploration game</strong> blending light puzzle-solving, atmospheric storytelling, and surreal world-building. As you traverse\u00a0 vibrant biomes, you\u2019ll encounter strange villagers, unlock their suppressed hopes, and stitch together the fractured emotional tapestry of a once-vibrant world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore Lost Dreams</strong>: Recover scattered dreams and return them to their rightful owners to transform their environment and inner world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Rich Puzzles</strong>: Solve environmental challenges that are tied to character arcs and world lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct Biomes</strong>: Explore painterly regions, each shaped by a unique emotional state and visual language.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living Archive</strong>: Unlock journal entries, memories, and lore artifacts that reveal the hidden history of the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
